{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_cello_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_cello_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"天空與流雲","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cello_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f9ab1b406b0f9025f4c9f643c74d4564ca3e79392439157c2024556962a35063","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿爾圖羅在林間演奏，這是一首關於別離的旋律。她的演奏引來了一位意想不到的聽眾，她在演奏後見到了一位意想不到的客人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風撥動深秋的喬木，琴聲正隨著落葉鋪滿整座樹林。\n阿米婭隨著琴聲行進。她的右手微微攥起，戒指在林蔭篩落的陽光裡隱隱閃爍著光芒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……黑髮的薩科塔站在林間的空地上，擁抱著她的琴，那麼專注。\n琴聲依然在“流動”，沒有因自己的到來有任何停滯。琴聲是溫柔的。\n阿米婭停下了腳步，手掌慢慢放鬆下來。漸漸地，連身遭的樹和遠處的雲都溶化成了水流，隱隱地在天際漾動，也在腳邊漾動……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不該隨意離開您的房間，何況，今天有一場……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩科塔女性輕輕抬動了眼眸，兩人之間仍隔著不近的距離，但阿米婭確定對方看見了自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g3_fogblockadestreet_d"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭沒有移動，但星光和浪濤主動擁抱了她，在萬千迷離的景象裡，無數熟悉的身影與她交錯。\n她覺得自己彷彿變成了一本書，而琴聲像是一雙手，向情感的最深處翻閱。\n費德里科曾經警告過所有人，遠離她的琴聲。\n但阿米婭不這麼想。\n她暗自深呼了一口氣。\n也只有她能這麼做。能去碰觸阿爾圖羅神秘紗帳下的面目，能去碰觸阿爾圖羅自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭聞聲回頭，純白如月光般的女性不知何時來到了自己的身後，目光溫柔，一如往常。\n阿米婭從對方的眼眸中看見了自己的模樣——\n抱著膝蓋坐在甲板的角落，瀏海微微遮住眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你已經在甲板上坐了好久了。你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，太陽快要落下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛工程隊的叔叔給了我一顆糖。特蕾西婭小姐，你們今天的工作結束了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。你在想爸爸媽媽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，爸爸結束工程隊的工作回到家，都會抱著我到工棚的棚頂上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"太陽落山的時候，氣溫會很快地降低。但爸爸的肩膀很厚，所以我們可以在上面待很長時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候，星星也在一顆一顆地冒出來，很快就會掛滿整個夜空……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，博士會陪著我，凱爾希醫生會陪著我，您也會陪著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"我就……偶爾……不那麼想爸爸媽媽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士說，在你們遊歷這片大地的一年裡，你才是那個給予對方以鼓舞的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"很慶幸博士救下了你，我也很開心羅德島能成為你的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"或許死亡並非最深刻的別離。但它一定是最殘忍的，它無可挽回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"而你已經能勇敢地面對它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"或許未來，你還會經歷更多別離。但記住，別離並不是終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你將感受，你將連接，你將延續，你將作為一切的交匯。你將作為，未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來你打算去哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……很感謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不會再止步不前了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"記憶中的特蕾西婭模糊了起來。\n“魔王”會贈他人幻景，魔王傳承記憶與技藝，傳承情感與知識。\n可阿米婭從來沒有深究過自己。\n就像兩面鏡子。阿米婭打開了那透明的門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"narration","text":"……而門外是一片草坪。\n剛剛下過雨，空氣的味道很好聞，不遠處的小教堂沉默地矗立著——\n所有的客人都已經離開，只剩下年幼的薩科塔站在一塊墓碑前。\n她沉默著，臉頰上還掛著水滴，分不清那是雨水還是眼淚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，阿爾圖羅小姐，這首旋律的主題，是“死亡”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很悲傷，阿爾圖羅小姐。你看，我也用了很久的時間，遇見了很多人，才能在想起爸爸媽媽的時候，不那麼難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止是悲傷，你還有疑惑和……憤怒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"針對什麼？那些已經走掉的客人嗎？還是，“死亡”本身？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿爾圖羅並沒有看見她。年幼的薩科塔佇立在曾經的歲月裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，你用了多大的勇氣，才勇敢地走出了那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼死亡可以那麼倉促地，掐斷你的人生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼死亡可以將人們的肉體變成一具空殼，那麼簡單就讓所有複雜的、深刻的情感都消失不見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我們只能像一朵雲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼自由，那麼美好，但是風颳過就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它讓我們為了彌補遺憾而做的所有努力，又變成了新的遺憾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1120_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你本可以，不必死去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g1_marigold"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉，而你本可以，不必死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在女皇慶典開始之前，你有許多機會可以離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，在金盞花小巷的時候，在路德維格大學的時候，甚至在塔前劇場的時候，你也有許多機會告訴我你的心聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知該如何表達嗎？可是你知道，我能聽懂你的琴聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嘗試過告訴薇薇安娜，希望她能透過金律樂章的線索，發現你的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可即使是她……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不願改變你的選擇，我也無法改變你的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。你其實比誰都清楚，我這一生，唯獨在死去的時候，沒有任何遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺憾的是你，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永遠記得我們的相遇，在艾曼紐老師的葬禮上，在夕陽下的女皇雙塔前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫你的琴調音，你向我講述一路走來遇見的人、經歷的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不清你的面容，但我清楚地聽見了你的琴聲，很動人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉，你向我袒露你的遺憾，以及這些遺憾賦予你的信念。你是第一個主動邀請我演奏自己心聲的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在漫長的漫遊裡，你是我為數不多的摯友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不願……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我的感情，我所經歷過的一切，真的會像流雲一般消散嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，我的摯友，為我演奏吧，讓我再聽一聽你的琴聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“珂拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直相信，這正是它所承載的意義。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"琴聲悠揚，更多未曾親歷的景象在阿爾圖羅面前展開。那些畫面、那些聲音溶化成一條河流，流向人生的未可知處。\n阿爾圖羅在河流中跋涉。\n不知道過了多久，也不知道是怎樣上岸的，等她睜開眼睛的時候，已經站在了一扇門前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了很遠吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是一間修道院？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一間建設在移動地塊上的修道院。和安布羅修修道院很像對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它已經陪著我在大地上漫遊了很多很多年。可現在，它已經停泊了兩個半月了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它朽壞了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是我生病了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在等待，等待死亡如期而至。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別看了，這裡只有我一個人，也不會有其他人過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡離拉特蘭很遠，遠到那些為了“拉特蘭主張”而奔走於整片大地的萬國信使也未曾涉足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想要問什麼，阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理想之所以為理想，在於它足夠遙遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去過許多地方，我靠近各個城市，進入散落著眾多生命的荒野、冰原和沙漠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去到每一處戰火頻仍的所在，我去到每一處被遺忘的止境……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漫長的漫遊裡，我從未放下我的琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我為形形色色的人演奏，可結果依然不盡如人意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強大的心靈、毫無保留的理解、純粹而真摯的分享……我為靠近那個未來有過許多努力，但它還，很遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你將死在這裡，一個僻遠的角落，一間殘破的修道院。死亡會將一切統統化作泡影，不會有任何事物留存下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你正握著你的琴，你將演奏自己的死亡？以恐懼、無奈、憤怒和悲傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像曾經的你一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窗外的雲又聚起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒法留住一朵雲。可我們要描繪的，難道不是一整片天空嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偉人會死，凡人會死，同行者會離我們而去。沒有人能夠改寫死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它會掐斷我們的人生，讓我們的肉體變成一具空殼，它將不能承載任何思想、任何感受，不會再有新的內容從中產生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這並不意味著，我們曾有的那些複雜而深刻的情感，會就此消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因為存在無法逾越的死亡，所以我必須演奏，不停地演奏。這樣那些消失的情感，才能繼續被所有人感受、理解與銘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不正是它所承載的意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，你是否想過，剛才所見的，真的可能是自己的未來？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很高興自己真的在靠近它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"narration","text":"弦音仍在樹林間迴盪。薩科塔慢慢將大提琴放進琴箱，卡特斯女孩安靜地看著對方的動作，等待她看向自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，把您捲進了我的旋律……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅小姐，您來羅德島後，我們還沒有機會正式打個招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起刻意的安排，今天這個場合，作為初見再合適不過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的能力很奇特。您甚至無需藉助樂器……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩面鏡子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡簡單單，卻能看見無數個自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和羅德島，都比我想像中的要有趣很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的演奏也很有趣……僅僅是那麼短的時間，我卻覺得我們已經有了相當程度的了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也時常觸碰那些情感嗎？您會理解我的想法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們終究是不同的，阿爾圖羅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想我們還有很多時間共處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，請您趕緊跟我回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用這麼焦急，我並沒有想要逃跑哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您確實擅離本艦有很長時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而恰好，有一位來自拉特蘭的貴客想要見您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可找您好久了呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小姐，回到船上後，不知是否還有機會正式邀請您參加我的演奏會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以不只成為一名聽眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。我們歡迎所有對羅德島懷有善意的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在您眼裡，我懷有善意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，您的想法無關善惡，我已經清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我會確保這一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒人再提起剛才發生的事情，一曲終了，演奏者與演奏者，聽眾與聽眾，總是有些默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我很喜歡這裡的景色。但可惜，我不能再多待一會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是一位，“貴客”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來阿米婭小姐遠比我想像的有能耐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很榮幸見到您……教宗閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於剛才跑過去的幾位感染者孩子而言，我只是“拉特蘭的糖果爺爺”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是“教宗”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"悉聽尊便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅·吉亞洛。這應該是我們的第一次見面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你看起來並不驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來萊塔尼亞之行，讓你充分長了見識，寬闊了眼界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我有關，又需要羅德島的負責人親自安排的……我想確實該是一位大人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我以為，這樣的場合會是在大教堂的大廳，教宗閣下會宣布對一位頻頻觸犯禁忌的危險分子的判決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，公證所登記在冊的，與你相關的異常事件，數量確實有些多到不合適了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等費德里科帶你回到拉特蘭，教皇廳將馬上組織第一廳、第五廳、第六廳、第七廳，對相關案件進行聯合審理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，依據律法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“律法”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在此之前，我們應該有一場會面。而它只能發生在羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，罪孽之子。此刻，你可以將這間宿舍視作臨時的告解室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我們談及的所有內容，將不會被記錄，在此後也不會被承認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已有覺悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有儀式，也無人見證。但也好，你本就不是什麼英雄豪傑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在此代表拉特蘭，宣布你，阿爾圖羅·吉亞洛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受選為下一位“聖徒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這似乎，並不是您的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼覺得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實這根本無關緊要。律法的選擇一定有其意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是費德里科接應您來的羅德島，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，在來的路上，您是如何向我們可愛的聖徒解釋，他剛剛緝拿歸案的逃犯，同樣被選作了聖徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科確實還不知道這件事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他會理解，我會要求他理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我並不是真的在縱容或寬恕你的所作所為，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不在乎律法的寬恕或是這個……名號。坦誠地說，還有點討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是教皇廳還有什麼需要利用我的時候嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你並不了解所有事。你的經歷，行為，理念，乃至反映到你法術之中的偏執……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是出現過無數次的，薩科塔對薩科塔的一種解讀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼確定，你的異稟天賦，你獨一無二的法術……不是律法刻意的顯現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你終究頭戴光環，是一個拉特蘭的薩科塔，阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白色的石牆在拉特蘭佇立千年萬年，你也並不是唯一一個，“異類”，哦，我也不喜歡這個詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我們光輝的律法依然堅定地給了我答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下，請問這個模糊的“答案”，意味著什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意味著……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們所知的任何光亮都有寂滅如黯的那一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它也不例外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老邁的教宗俏皮地指了指頭頂的光環。\n阿爾圖羅陷入沉思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……即使薩科塔的一切都被解讀成“它”賦予的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"教宗沒有回答，反而唐突地詢問了下一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除去你的偏執，你的傲慢，你的罪，你還會是什麼？你還要做什麼？還要帶來什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找，教宗閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撒謊對您是無意義的。不過您說，光環會消失……薩科塔會失去信仰和溫馨的小屋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不過是把拉特蘭變得和其他地方一樣而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所想的“理解”，我所想的“情感”，我所想的無所保留的，純粹而坦誠的……“交流”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與您說的事情沒有關係。一丁點都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……即使如此，律法也堅持把我選做所謂的“聖徒”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……我會說，“是的”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你給出了比我想像中更合理的答案，看來在萊塔尼亞發生的事情比情報文書裡寫的過分得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……如果我拒絕成為聖徒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，這是您為我安排的“贖罪”，我並沒有選擇的權利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子。選擇權依然在你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是向一位拉特蘭公民，傳達我所收到的警示而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站在聖跡最頂點的您，將選擇權交給一個罪人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你也知道，教宗總是會巧妙地撬動神諭裡的字句，比如，在聖徒的人選上換一個名字之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會。我沒有在威脅你。反正費德里科會處理好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您既然依舊這麼想，又為什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——但在太陽落下的時候，你的所思所想也許會是一劑良藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“聖徒”是薩科塔岌岌可危的一個訊號。我只能，更不擇手段一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再者，你引發的悲劇也是你自身的悲劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔，拉特蘭，信仰，共感，交流，我們的社會。這些東西構成了你的故事，構成了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那哪一位教宗不該對此負責？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在深刻反思後，我決定親自領你走向終點，小聖徒。在你的使命完成之後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領你們每一個人，得到你們應得的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼樣的終點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。我可不是什麼大先知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……當然，就現狀來看，你應得的未來可談不上前途光明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出，您做出這樣的決定，也承擔了不少壓力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況也許真的糟糕到了我們要賭一把的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，阿爾圖羅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能否接受，成為一位聖徒的聽眾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對音樂懂的不多，不過先等等……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站太久了，我們就不能去羅德島舒適的會客室坐一會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以邊走邊聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。嘿喲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請開始吧。我想聽些更“拉特蘭”一點的調子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"窗外，白日的尾巴倔強地在天空留下輪廓，暮色燦爛。\n她沒來由地想起崔林特爾梅的晚霞，想起曾見過的許多個城市的雲。\n天色已經漸漸暗了，而腳下傳來輕微的晃動，這艘船即將駛入黑夜。\n艦橋上的燈亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"旋律響起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
